WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
Tom Bergstrom: We have four renewals entering the hundred twenty day window this month.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.000
Rachel Kim: Any of them showing churn risk signals already?

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
